發客製化AI記憶體（如UWIO）與擴展3D晶圓封裝測試服務，深化與客戶的合作，提升產品附加價值與客戶黏著度。","summary":"南亞科2026年第二季的營收結構主要以DDR4與LPDDR4合計佔總營收超過70%，DDR5與DDR3則各佔約10%。在2026年上半年，AI基礎設施與伺服器應用佔南亞科營收的比例已超過20%。公司主要客戶涵蓋NVIDIA、Google、Microsoft、Intel、AMD、Qualcomm等全球主要晶片與雲端業者，以及SanDisk、Kioxia、Solidigm和Cisco等策略投資人兼客戶。","source_type":"news","source":"南亞科做什麼的？解析台灣DRAM 記憶體大廠4 大業務、2026 最新財報與未來展望 (2026/09/30)","data_period":"2026 Q2","updated_at":"2026-10-06"}},{"sector":"CoPoS封裝","id":"2467","name":"志聖","price":130.5,"rsi":60.6,"cv_sharpe":1.9,"bias_ma10":null,"sector_strong":null,"trend_analysis":{"code":"2467","trend_status":"多頭排列","ma_alignment":"多頭排列 MA5>MA10>MA20","trend_strength":75,"ma5":565.2,"ma10":550.3,"ma20":544.2,"ma60":548.38,"current_price":552.0,"bias_ma5":-2.34,"bias_ma10":0.31,"bias_ma20":1.43,"volume_status":"量能正常","volume_ratio_5d":0.88,"volume_trend":"量能正常","support_ma5":false,"support_ma10":true,"buy_signal":"強力買入","signal_score":92,"signal_reasons":["多頭排列，順勢做多","價格略低於MA5(-2.3%)，回踩買點","MA10支撐有效","MACD 中性區域","RSI中性(49.4)，震盪整理中","強勢族群加持，資金輪動有利"],"risk_factors":[],"macd_dif":0.2262,"macd_dea":-3.4515,"macd_bar":7.3554,"macd_status":"多頭","macd_signal":"MACD 中性區域","rsi_6":47.7,"rsi_12":49.4,"rsi_24":49.2,"rsi_status":"中性","rsi_signal":"RSI中性(49.4)，震盪整理中","sector_is_strong":true,"kd_k":61.83,"kd_d":61.03,"kd_j":63.41,"kd_k_prev":69.88,"kd_d_prev":60.64,"macd_bar_prev":4.78,"entry_strategy":{"vol_ratio":1.01,"vol_ok":false,"macd_momentum":false,"passed":false,"grade":"C"}},"product_mix":{"product_lines":[{"name":"半導體先進封裝設備","share_pct":46,"yoy_growth":null,"trend":"up"},{"name":"先進PCB設備","share_pct":24,"yoy_growth":null,"trend":"down"},{"name":"其他 (未揭露明細)","share_pct":30,"yoy_growth":null,"trend":"down"}],"regions":[],"customers":["台積電 (TSMC)","日月光投控 (ASE)","欣興","景碩","南電","臻鼎-KY","健鼎","華通","友達","群創","三星 (Samsung)","京東方 (BOE)","NVIDIA"],"biz_model":"自有品牌精密製程設備製造商，專注於光熱核心技術，並提供客製化解決方案與系統整合服務。","moat":"1. 深耕光熱濕電漿五大核心技術數十年，技術門檻高且不易複製。2. 設備導入大客戶產線後，因更換涉及良率、可靠度與再驗證成本，形成高轉換成本的護城河。3. 透過G2C+聯盟（志聖、均豪、均華、東捷）提供一站式、整合性的先進封裝解決方案，強化競爭優勢。4. 成功從傳統PCB與面板設備供應商轉型為半導體先進封裝關鍵戰略樞紐，並連年獲得台積電優良供應商獎項肯定。5. 持續投入研發並具備與客戶共同開發新機種及客製化設備的能力.","summary":"志聖已成功從傳統PCB設備商轉型為半導體及AI基礎設施的關鍵設備供應商。2026年上半年，半導體先進封裝設備佔總營收46%，先進PCB設備佔24%，兩者合計達70%。公司憑藉其深厚的光熱技術、與主要客戶的緊密合作及G2C+聯盟的綜效，在AI驅動的先進封裝市場中具備顯著的核心競爭優勢.","source_type":"investor_conference","source":"散戶鬥嘴鼓 志聖(2467)法說會重點整理 2026/08/26","data_period":"2026H1","updated_at":"2026-10-06"}}],"dualFilterExcluded":[],"sectors":[{"sector":"光通訊","ret20":-2.06,"rsi":38.8,"buy":1,"hot":0},{"sector":"記憶體","ret20":1.12,"rsi":55.2,"buy":2,"hot":1},{"sector":"AI伺服器","ret20":10.04,"rsi":54.4,"buy":0,"hot":2},{"sector":"封測","ret20":9.94,"rsi":50.3,"buy":0,"hot":0},{"sector":"光學","ret20":5.25,"rsi":61.4,"buy":0,"hot":1},{"sector":"IC設計","ret20":-3.07,"rsi":43.5,"buy":1,"hot":0},{"sector":"車用電子","ret20":-8.0,"rsi":37.1,"buy":0,"hot":0},{"sector":"綠能環保","ret20":13.91,"rsi":64.9,"buy":0,"hot":0},{"sector":"CoPoS封裝","ret20":9.04,"rsi":48.6,"buy":3,"hot":0}],"chips":[],"stocks":[{"date":"20240327","sector":"光通訊","id":"4979","name":"華星光","price":120.5,"rsi":21.5,"rsi10":"","ret20":-23.2,"signal":"HOLD","sharpe":7.49,"foreign":"","trust":"","dealer":"","chipTotal":0,"chip5d":null,"chipDays":null,"chipConc":null,"chipDualBuy":null,"trustDays":null,"chipTier":null,"news":""},{"date":"20240327","sector":"光通訊","id":"3450","name":"聯鈞","price":72.5,"rsi":48.9,"rsi10":"","ret20":4.0,"signal":"BUY","sharpe":4.68,"foreign":"","trust":"","dealer":"","chipTotal":0,"chip5d":null,"chipDays":null,"chipConc":null,"chipDualBuy":null,"trustDays":null,"chipTier":null,"news":""},{"date":"20240327","sector":"光通訊","id":"3665","name":"貿聯-KY","price":252.0,"rsi":62.9,"rsi10":"","ret20":4.6,"signal":"HOLD","sharpe":0.0,"foreign":"","trust":"","dealer":"","chipTotal":0,"chip5d":null,"chipDays":null,"chipConc":null,"chipDualBuy":null,"trustDays":null,"chipTier":null,"news":""},{"date":"20240327","sector":"光通訊","id":"3105","name":"穩懋","price":147.0,"rsi":33.1,"rsi10":"","ret20":-3.3,"signal":"HOLD","sharpe":0.0,"f